/given-names></name><name><surname>Zhang</surname><given-names>LF</given-names></name><name><surname>Shima</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>McCarrey</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Griswold</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Postmeiotic sex chromatin in the male germline of mice.</article-title><source>Curr Biol</source><year>2006</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>660</fpage><lpage>667</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16581510</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.cub.2006.01.066</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Csankovszki</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>McDonel</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Meyer</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Recruitment and spreading of the <italic>C. elegans </italic>dosage compensation complex along X chromosomes.</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2004</year><volume>303</volume><fpage>1182</fpage><lpage>1185</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14976312</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.1092938</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Oh</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Bone</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuroda</surname><given-names>MI</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Multiple classes of MSL binding sites target dosage compensation to the X chromosome of <italic>Drosophila</italic>.</article-title><source>Curr Biol</source><year>2004</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>481</fpage><lpage>487</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15043812</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.cub.2004.03.004</pub-id></citation></re